 ],
 "notes": "Documenso is a monorepo with the main app in apps/remix (React Router / Remix). It uses Lingui for i18n (no static JSON locale files in source \u2014 compiled at build time). The Holostaff SDK is already integrated: it initialises from the authenticated layout and calls markStageEntry based on route patterns. The app uses a multi-tenant hierarchy: User \u2192 Organisation \u2192 Team, with documents and templates scoped to teams. Recipients (signers) use separate unauthenticated routes (/sign/:token) and are deliberately excluded from the copilot scope.",
 "depth": "full",
